;;
;; Rung 2 configuration for this store (ADR 0023, ADR 0026).
;;
;; :audience is the anti-replay control. A token minted for another
;; service is a valid token from the same issuer about the same subject,
;; and without an expected audience it would bind here just as well —
;; declaring one is what makes `verify` refuse it.
;;
;; :bindings names which subjects may bind which actor. Every GitHub
;; repository can obtain a token with this audience, so only the release
;; workflow on this repository's main branch may bind `ci`.
{:audience "tik"
 :bindings {"ci" [{:issuer "https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com"
                   :subject "repo:metio/tik:ref:refs/heads/main"}]}}
